(2910539, 407264, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is great.  There is something special in the photo that you captured.  But the processing is ghastly and takes away all the delicate textures and features of the skin.  It takes away the humanity of your photo and undoes all your good work.  It would be better to have noise than to have plastic skin.</td>', 'I think the idea is great.  There is something special in the photo that you captured.  But the processing is ghastly and takes away all the delicate textures and features of the skin.  It takes away the humanity of your photo and undoes all your good work.  It would be better to have noise than to have plastic skin.', '2006-10-09 09:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
