(2910785, 408229, 64175, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m probably just missing something, but I don''t really get the title.  Quitar is a verb for (1) to remove (2) to get rid of  or (3) to take off (as in clothing) .   The title just doesn''t go with the pick.<br/> <br/>But I guess you could say the guitarist really "brought the house down). Technically, it is a pretty nice shot.  Subject is a little dark as they fall into the shaded portion of the picture.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m probably just missing something, but I don''t really get the title.  Quitar is a verb for (1) to remove (2) to get rid of  or (3) to take off (as in clothing) .   The title just doesn''t go with the pick. But I guess you could say the guitarist really "brought the house down). Technically, it is a pretty nice shot.  Subject is a little dark as they fall into the shaded portion of the picture.', '2006-10-09 10:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
