(2911563, 408494, 60343, '<td valign="top">Unforgettable combination of elements. Strong color works perfectly with Boschian subject. The stuff of nightmares but in a good way. Now I know what to do with that old surplus gas mask.</td>', 'Unforgettable combination of elements. Strong color works perfectly with Boschian subject. The stuff of nightmares but in a good way. Now I know what to do with that old surplus gas mask.', '2006-10-09 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
