(2912750, 408341, 53690, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this image, it definitely captures the essence of a child and his current favorite toy.  I think this would really benefit from some sharpening, and perhaps a bit of contrast.  Black and white might be a good option as well.  Way to capture the mood though!</td>', 'I really like the idea of this image, it definitely captures the essence of a child and his current favorite toy.  I think this would really benefit from some sharpening, and perhaps a bit of contrast.  Black and white might be a good option as well.  Way to capture the mood though!', '2006-10-09 22:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
