(2914522, 408500, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice light and concept. The use of the hat to hide the model''s face is great. I find the focus should be on the hands though. The hat is tak sharp but the hands, which in my view are the fulcral part of the composition, are a bit soft. Still, a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice light and concept. The use of the hat to hide the model''s face is great. I find the focus should be on the hands though. The hat is tak sharp but the hands, which in my view are the fulcral part of the composition, are a bit soft. Still, a nice shot.', '2006-10-10 15:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914526, 408372, 41554, '<td valign="top">I find the model''s figure overpowering in this pic. I think it would work better if this was shot from a longer distance IMHO.</td>', 'I find the model''s figure overpowering in this pic. I think it would work better if this was shot from a longer distance IMHO.', '2006-10-10 15:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914533, 408557, 41554, '<td valign="top">This is kind of disconcerting. What do we know about Frankie? He''s got some kind of scratch or something in his thumb. Also, he is not very young, wears glasses and his hair is failing. He likes shirts. But, what the heck is that he is holding in his head/ear?</td>', 'This is kind of disconcerting. What do we know about Frankie? He''s got some kind of scratch or something in his thumb. Also, he is not very young, wears glasses and his hair is failing. He likes shirts. But, what the heck is that he is holding in his head/ear?', '2006-10-10 15:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914540, 408522, 41554, '<td valign="top">The composition is totally centered... I think centering requires a very strong subject, and a person standing with the back to the camera rarely is such a subject.</td>', 'The composition is totally centered... I think centering requires a very strong subject, and a person standing with the back to the camera rarely is such a subject.', '2006-10-10 15:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914547, 406156, 41554, '<td valign="top">The light in this is both good and bad... good because it creates an interesting shadow (left hand of the subject) and bad because it hides precious detail on the right hand.</td>', 'The light in this is both good and bad... good because it creates an interesting shadow (left hand of the subject) and bad because it hides precious detail on the right hand.', '2006-10-10 15:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
