(2914841, 407850, 3102, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest in saying that I''m not fond of the editing here.  The skin tones are unnatural, and the sky and grass aren''t usually all that purple.  It just seems like these things were toned for the sake of toning them.  I have no problem with altering colors if there''s a good *reason*, but that doesn''t seem to be the case here.  It seems like she''s hugging her child because nuclear radiation is lighting up her town or something... :/</td>', 'I have to be honest in saying that I''m not fond of the editing here.  The skin tones are unnatural, and the sky and grass aren''t usually all that purple.  It just seems like these things were toned for the sake of toning them.  I have no problem with altering colors if there''s a good *reason*, but that doesn''t seem to be the case here.  It seems like she''s hugging her child because nuclear radiation is lighting up her town or something... :/', '2006-10-10 17:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914844, 406883, 66193, '<td valign="top">the title kind of baits us into thinking that''s another finger!  without the title, I would have seen something along the lines of "this is where the ring is going".  I think the title detracts from a very nice "faceless portrait" since it forces us into thinking along certain lines, as opposed to letting us put our own emotion or interpretation into it.</td>', 'the title kind of baits us into thinking that''s another finger!  without the title, I would have seen something along the lines of "this is where the ring is going".  I think the title detracts from a very nice "faceless portrait" since it forces us into thinking along certain lines, as opposed to letting us put our own emotion or interpretation into it.', '2006-10-10 17:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914849, 408521, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the colors on this one, especially.  Interesting pose, too!</td>', 'I like the colors on this one, especially.  Interesting pose, too!', '2006-10-10 17:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914850, 408220, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little cutesy, but well done.  would have been helped by more sharpness (focus), and a little more contrast.  nice interpretation of the challenge. 7.</td>', 'a little cutesy, but well done.  would have been helped by more sharpness (focus), and a little more contrast.  nice interpretation of the challenge. 7.', '2006-10-10 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
