(2917368, 408092, 24073, '<td valign="top">The technicals look fabulous on this photo, and the image is nice.  However I don''t think it fully comes across.  The image seems to lack emotion, and for some reason I have a pre-fab or (staged) taste in my mouth.  Certainly above par don''t get me wrong, and I adore this photo, I''m just trying to make a helpful comment.  GL</td>', 'The technicals look fabulous on this photo, and the image is nice.  However I don''t think it fully comes across.  The image seems to lack emotion, and for some reason I have a pre-fab or (staged) taste in my mouth.  Certainly above par don''t get me wrong, and I adore this photo, I''m just trying to make a helpful comment.  GL', '2006-10-11 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917380, 408303, 63398, '<td valign="top">Good thinking!<br/>What better place to find a faceless portrait than at a Renn-fair!<br/>I would not have thought of that.</td>', 'Good thinking!What better place to find a faceless portrait than at a Renn-fair!I would not have thought of that.', '2006-10-11 09:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
