(2917677, 406551, 66833, '<td valign="top">This photo is really fantastic! I love the concept.. great job!</td>', 'This photo is really fantastic! I love the concept.. great job!', '2006-10-11 11:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917688, 408303, 49384, '<td valign="top">Go SCA!</td>', 'Go SCA!', '2006-10-11 11:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917767, 408550, 60915, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and would be interested to see how this would look as a B&amp;W, nice job.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and would be interested to see how this would look as a B&W, nice job.', '2006-10-11 11:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917810, 408484, 30982, '<td valign="top">She quite definitely has a face, and a lovely one at that.  The composition is quite nice with the window and the red reeds.  However, for this particular challenge, I think less face would have served you better.</td>', 'She quite definitely has a face, and a lovely one at that.  The composition is quite nice with the window and the red reeds.  However, for this particular challenge, I think less face would have served you better.', '2006-10-11 11:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917817, 406158, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and the composition on this but am not so sure about the filter.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and the composition on this but am not so sure about the filter.', '2006-10-11 11:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917824, 408454, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the elephant''s eye and markings in this.  I realize there''s a man there, but it''s the elephant I find fascinating.</td>', 'I like the elephant''s eye and markings in this.  I realize there''s a man there, but it''s the elephant I find fascinating.', '2006-10-11 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917828, 408556, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this pose alot - what might have been really neat is to have the baby''s hand in focus on the shoulder.</td>', 'I like this pose alot - what might have been really neat is to have the baby''s hand in focus on the shoulder.', '2006-10-11 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917835, 408017, 30982, '<td valign="top">The mask makes it faceless, but it seems the lights are the more prominent features of the shot while the figure seems to fade into the background.  This could be what you were intending, of course.</td>', 'The mask makes it faceless, but it seems the lights are the more prominent features of the shot while the figure seems to fade into the background.  This could be what you were intending, of course.', '2006-10-11 11:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917838, 405518, 30982, '<td valign="top">The light seems a bit harsh to me for what you may be trying to depict.  A bit more of the environment might add to this as well.</td>', 'The light seems a bit harsh to me for what you may be trying to depict.  A bit more of the environment might add to this as well.', '2006-10-11 11:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917843, 408224, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, perspective.  I like how he''s framed within the picture by the features of the land and the sky.</td>', 'Nice colors, perspective.  I like how he''s framed within the picture by the features of the land and the sky.', '2006-10-11 11:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917849, 408467, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever and humorous!</td>', 'Clever and humorous!', '2006-10-11 11:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917858, 408482, 30982, '<td valign="top">The softness is nice though maybe a bit too much on the top of her hat.  The sole of her shoe bothers me just a bit - it draws the eye.  Colors are wonderful and the sentiment is sweet.</td>', 'The softness is nice though maybe a bit too much on the top of her hat.  The sole of her shoe bothers me just a bit - it draws the eye.  Colors are wonderful and the sentiment is sweet.', '2006-10-11 11:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917862, 408562, 30982, '<td valign="top">The light on the flag and person is excellent.  I do wish the paper/board in front of the face was either a different color or had more to it - texture, a picture, more translucent - as it stands it''s kind of jarring.  Then again, that could be what you''re after, too!</td>', 'The light on the flag and person is excellent.  I do wish the paper/board in front of the face was either a different color or had more to it - texture, a picture, more translucent - as it stands it''s kind of jarring.  Then again, that could be what you''re after, too!', '2006-10-11 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917864, 408052, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast!</td>', 'Nice contrast!', '2006-10-11 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917869, 408438, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures.</td>', 'Very nice textures.', '2006-10-11 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917939, 408001, 30982, '<td valign="top">The toning here is very nice.  I like the contrast between the feather and the shirt, too.</td>', 'The toning here is very nice.  I like the contrast between the feather and the shirt, too.', '2006-10-11 12:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917941, 407397, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines and shadow in this.</td>', 'Lovely lines and shadow in this.', '2006-10-11 12:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917944, 408494, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Well executed, well titled, too.</td>', 'Too funny!  Well executed, well titled, too.', '2006-10-11 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917945, 406987, 30049, '<td valign="top">Quite frankly, the first thought that came to mind when I saw this image is "Cook" or "Maid".  I think it''s the apron and the upright (prim) sitting position.  Peeling potatos in our household is much messier than this and usually done at the sink.  :D<br/> <br/>All that aside, the image is well done with a nice range of tones. I''d have been tempted to square crop this or move the subject to center as it''s nearly centered now.</td>', 'Quite frankly, the first thought that came to mind when I saw this image is "Cook" or "Maid".  I think it''s the apron and the upright (prim) sitting position.  Peeling potatos in our household is much messier than this and usually done at the sink.  :D All that aside, the image is well done with a nice range of tones. I''d have been tempted to square crop this or move the subject to center as it''s nearly centered now.', '2006-10-11 12:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917948, 408521, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  Love the pose.</td>', 'Nice image!  Love the pose.', '2006-10-11 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917949, 408127, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet, soft shot.</td>', 'Sweet, soft shot.', '2006-10-11 12:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917952, 406146, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely an interesting angle, but the light seems just a bit harsh on the garment.</td>', 'Definitely an interesting angle, but the light seems just a bit harsh on the garment.', '2006-10-11 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917954, 408224, 30049, '<td valign="top">They don''t grow clouds THAT smooth in our neck of the woods.  :D  This is a nice photo although I think the subject is not a large enough piece of the message/story for a portrait themed challenge.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'They don''t grow clouds THAT smooth in our neck of the woods.  :D  This is a nice photo although I think the subject is not a large enough piece of the message/story for a portrait themed challenge.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917960, 408234, 30982, '<td valign="top">The processing makes this more interesting than it would be without it.  The shadows add nicely to the composition.</td>', 'The processing makes this more interesting than it would be without it.  The shadows add nicely to the composition.', '2006-10-11 12:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917962, 407790, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see what you''re going for here and I suspect it may work better with a dark background.  The hat thing almost looks like a furry critter of some sort, though.</td>', 'I can see what you''re going for here and I suspect it may work better with a dark background.  The hat thing almost looks like a furry critter of some sort, though.', '2006-10-11 12:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917963, 407987, 30982, '<td valign="top">Out there, but well done.</td>', 'Out there, but well done.', '2006-10-11 12:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917966, 408110, 28801, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity</td>', 'I love the creativity', '2006-10-11 12:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917970, 407760, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oops!  There''s a whole lot of face showing here.  It''s a very intense and interesting image, I''ll give it that.  :)  The challenge is to <i>"show us the essence of a person"</i> without showing their face.  Disregarding the face issue, what does ''The Enthusiast'' mean?  I''m really not trying to be a smart aleck here...just giving some feedback on what questions this photo raises when I look at it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Oops!  There''s a whole lot of face showing here.  It''s a very intense and interesting image, I''ll give it that.  :)  The challenge is to "show us the essence of a person" without showing their face.  Disregarding the face issue, what does ''The Enthusiast'' mean?  I''m really not trying to be a smart aleck here...just giving some feedback on what questions this photo raises when I look at it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 12:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917971, 406883, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of the gesture - is she bragging that she doesn''t wear a wedding ring?</td>', 'Not sure what to make of the gesture - is she bragging that she doesn''t wear a wedding ring?', '2006-10-11 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917974, 404994, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colors are lovely in this.  I almost think I''d prefer the composition if it were cropped a bit more on the right.</td>', 'Colors are lovely in this.  I almost think I''d prefer the composition if it were cropped a bit more on the right.', '2006-10-11 12:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917981, 408487, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very powerful - love the light on the wall - the texture reflects that of the skin.</td>', 'Very powerful - love the light on the wall - the texture reflects that of the skin.', '2006-10-11 12:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917983, 407399, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve managed to frame this to obscure part or all of the faces.</td>', 'I like how you''ve managed to frame this to obscure part or all of the faces.', '2006-10-11 12:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917985, 408038, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-10-11 12:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2917987, 406903, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful location!  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Wonderful location!  Nicely composed.', '2006-10-11 12:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918005, 408523, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great use of concrete - makes a lovely backdrop!</td>', 'Great use of concrete - makes a lovely backdrop!', '2006-10-11 12:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918008, 406874, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate interpretation of the challenge.  In the DPC world, this could probably use some more drastic post processing to add "depth" or shadow or something (I''ve not figured it out yet).</td>', 'Very appropriate interpretation of the challenge.  In the DPC world, this could probably use some more drastic post processing to add "depth" or shadow or something (I''ve not figured it out yet).', '2006-10-11 12:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918011, 408302, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting location for a pregnancy shoot - sky seems a little off in color - maybe crop in the trees?</td>', 'Interesting location for a pregnancy shoot - sky seems a little off in color - maybe crop in the trees?', '2006-10-11 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918013, 407002, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I especially like the motion of the hands.  The fire of light at the end is a delightful bonus.</td>', 'Nice!  I especially like the motion of the hands.  The fire of light at the end is a delightful bonus.', '2006-10-11 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918014, 406987, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge!</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge!', '2006-10-11 12:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918059, 408010, 30608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candid style photo that fits the "Faceless Portrait" perfectly. Nice color tones and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful candid style photo that fits the "Faceless Portrait" perfectly. Nice color tones and composition.', '2006-10-11 12:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918167, 407278, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice high contrast!  Lovely form as well.</td>', 'Very nice high contrast!  Lovely form as well.', '2006-10-11 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918168, 407958, 33560, '<td valign="top">Almost every technical aspect of this shot seems a bit off:  The focus on the tablecloth is sharper than the focus on the subject''s hands; so, too is the lighting.  The color pallet is bizarre and there is much too much detail in the backdrop, though it is nice that the mirror and the tablecloth share a similar purple that complements pink. The curlers being an essential part of the composition are not well lit and are just about chopped off at the top. The hands, which might be quite expressive are not properly lit.  And the darkness of the mirror really does suck whatever life there might have been in the photo, right out of it.  The result is a photo of curlers, backdrop, and a sort of metaphorical black hole.<br/> <br/>All that said, if one were trying to make a political statement about the process of making a beauty queen and the result of the process, it would be hard to choose a better example than this one.</td>', 'Almost every technical aspect of this shot seems a bit off:  The focus on the tablecloth is sharper than the focus on the subject''s hands; so, too is the lighting.  The color pallet is bizarre and there is much too much detail in the backdrop, though it is nice that the mirror and the tablecloth share a similar purple that complements pink. The curlers being an essential part of the composition are not well lit and are just about chopped off at the top. The hands, which might be quite expressive are not properly lit.  And the darkness of the mirror really does suck whatever life there might have been in the photo, right out of it.  The result is a photo of curlers, backdrop, and a sort of metaphorical black hole. All that said, if one were trying to make a political statement about the process of making a beauty queen and the result of the process, it would be hard to choose a better example than this one.', '2006-10-11 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918171, 406640, 30982, '<td valign="top">A little too soft and flat as far as lighting to score well, but nicely composed.</td>', 'A little too soft and flat as far as lighting to score well, but nicely composed.', '2006-10-11 13:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918177, 408425, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good color to match the Halloween theme - nice light on the branch.  I think maybe if the ghost weren''t quite so clost to center it would be a bit more effective.  Still, an interesting entry!</td>', 'Very good color to match the Halloween theme - nice light on the branch.  I think maybe if the ghost weren''t quite so clost to center it would be a bit more effective.  Still, an interesting entry!', '2006-10-11 13:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918180, 408550, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice golden light.</td>', 'Nice golden light.', '2006-10-11 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918182, 408046, 30982, '<td valign="top">An effective photo - this would probably do well as a stock picture.</td>', 'An effective photo - this would probably do well as a stock picture.', '2006-10-11 13:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918183, 407471, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge!</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge!', '2006-10-11 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918187, 407264, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think a bit too much processing - the hands look very plastic, particularly the one in the lower right.  The idea is very nice, though.</td>', 'I think a bit too much processing - the hands look very plastic, particularly the one in the lower right.  The idea is very nice, though.', '2006-10-11 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918196, 407470, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice fall color, good rule of thirds.  Like the shadow of the farmer, too.</td>', 'Very nice fall color, good rule of thirds.  Like the shadow of the farmer, too.', '2006-10-11 13:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918197, 408492, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well executed.</td>', 'Nice idea, well executed.', '2006-10-11 13:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918211, 408257, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice way to sneak a lovely landscape into this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice way to sneak a lovely landscape into this challenge.', '2006-10-11 13:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918231, 408015, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the challenge!  Lovely outfit for the young lady - the flare of the skirt especially works.  The background is a nice professional finishing touch.  (Is this Odyssey?)</td>', 'Great interpretation of the challenge!  Lovely outfit for the young lady - the flare of the skirt especially works.  The background is a nice professional finishing touch.  (Is this Odyssey?)', '2006-10-11 13:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918232, 406151, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and processing!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and processing!', '2006-10-11 13:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918250, 405421, 30982, '<td valign="top">I originally thought this a bit snap-shot-ish but the more I look at it the more I like it.  I like that they''re all looking somewhere different and portray the carriage of young men so well.  I like the repeating dock structures just beyond them, and I like the contrast of their dark clothing to the surroundings.</td>', 'I originally thought this a bit snap-shot-ish but the more I look at it the more I like it.  I like that they''re all looking somewhere different and portray the carriage of young men so well.  I like the repeating dock structures just beyond them, and I like the contrast of their dark clothing to the surroundings.', '2006-10-11 13:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918261, 408010, 28532, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  I love the soft look ~ it helps give it that innocent feel!  Very nice - gonna bump up the score and adding it to my favorites!</td>', 'Beautiful!!  I love the soft look ~ it helps give it that innocent feel!  Very nice - gonna bump up the score and adding it to my favorites!', '2006-10-11 13:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918356, 407628, 33560, '<td valign="top">The use of light and color here is superb.  And I find the narrative provided by the fabric and title to be compelling.  Very nice.</td>', 'The use of light and color here is superb.  And I find the narrative provided by the fabric and title to be compelling.  Very nice.', '2006-10-11 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918359, 408454, 33560, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Inspired composition, lovely lighting.</td>', 'Fantastic! Inspired composition, lovely lighting.', '2006-10-11 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918360, 405521, 33560, '<td valign="top">Hah!  you have defaced the cabbage. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Hah!  you have defaced the cabbage. Very nice shot.', '2006-10-11 13:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918375, 407410, 33560, '<td valign="top">The soft tonal gradation and exqisite detail  perfectly complement a profoundly strong composition. WOW.</td>', 'The soft tonal gradation and exqisite detail  perfectly complement a profoundly strong composition. WOW.', '2006-10-11 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918380, 408038, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the light, the wam color, the short depth of field. Very nice.</td>', 'I love the light, the wam color, the short depth of field. Very nice.', '2006-10-11 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918408, 406987, 33560, '<td valign="top">There is something playfully subversive about this image: the static pose, the way the subject is sort of gratuitously ediited out of the photo, the static, but not quite perfectly symmetrical composition - that I really like.</td>', 'There is something playfully subversive about this image: the static pose, the way the subject is sort of gratuitously ediited out of the photo, the static, but not quite perfectly symmetrical composition - that I really like.', '2006-10-11 13:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918433, 408534, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the compostion, and the choice of color pallet.  There is something about the way the contrast or curves work to blur detail and force our eye to the subject that feels  a tad contrived or overdone to me.</td>', 'I love the compostion, and the choice of color pallet.  There is something about the way the contrast or curves work to blur detail and force our eye to the subject that feels  a tad contrived or overdone to me.', '2006-10-11 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918453, 408476, 33560, '<td valign="top">She is the apple of your eye!  I like the baggy suit.  I wish the background were a little more blurry, though I understand that unless you have a really big apple, such a thing would not be possible in a small studio.</td>', 'She is the apple of your eye!  I like the baggy suit.  I wish the background were a little more blurry, though I understand that unless you have a really big apple, such a thing would not be possible in a small studio.', '2006-10-11 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918462, 406146, 33560, '<td valign="top">There is a kind of snapshot quality to this photo that appropriately seems to say "quickly."</td>', 'There is a kind of snapshot quality to this photo that appropriately seems to say "quickly."', '2006-10-11 14:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918478, 408301, 33560, '<td valign="top">The choice of B&amp;W was ideally suited to this shot.  It emphasizes the texture of hair and hands and accentuates the strong sense of focus on the subject. It''s a lovely composition, with a strong and appealing narrative sense.</td>', 'The choice of B&W was ideally suited to this shot.  It emphasizes the texture of hair and hands and accentuates the strong sense of focus on the subject. It''s a lovely composition, with a strong and appealing narrative sense.', '2006-10-11 14:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918488, 407548, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun, playful, and an adorable image.  I think you''ve captured the "essence" of this toddler quite well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fun, playful, and an adorable image.  I think you''ve captured the "essence" of this toddler quite well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 14:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918494, 407914, 33560, '<td valign="top">The soft light and subtle grays in this shot take some time to work their magic.  But if we give the photo time to work the echoes between the faces - their shapes, textures, and directional gazes - draw us into the life of the photo and it comes alive.  Very nice!</td>', 'The soft light and subtle grays in this shot take some time to work their magic.  But if we give the photo time to work the echoes between the faces - their shapes, textures, and directional gazes - draw us into the life of the photo and it comes alive.  Very nice!', '2006-10-11 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918497, 407497, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm...where''s the person?  Not much "essence" when it comes to mannequins...</td>', 'Ummm...where''s the person?  Not much "essence" when it comes to mannequins...', '2006-10-11 14:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918521, 408500, 33560, '<td valign="top">The strong directional lighting and perfectly controlled depth of field strongly accentuate a strong composition.  I love the lines, the textures, and the narrative sense.</td>', 'The strong directional lighting and perfectly controlled depth of field strongly accentuate a strong composition.  I love the lines, the textures, and the narrative sense.', '2006-10-11 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918528, 406551, 33560, '<td valign="top">Super!</td>', 'Super!', '2006-10-11 14:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918551, 406551, 64733, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and i like the contrast.  nice effect.</td>', 'Very cool idea and i like the contrast.  nice effect.', '2006-10-11 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918553, 408482, 64733, '<td valign="top">a very compelling shot. lovely.</td>', 'a very compelling shot. lovely.', '2006-10-11 14:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
