(2918575, 406867, 64733, '<td valign="top">great action shot with soft edges and wonderful hues.  nciely done.</td>', 'great action shot with soft edges and wonderful hues.  nciely done.', '2006-10-11 14:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918579, 408052, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and processed. I like the glowing sensibility, the frame, and the BG.</td>', 'Nicely exposed and processed. I like the glowing sensibility, the frame, and the BG.', '2006-10-11 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918600, 408419, 33560, '<td valign="top">In some cultures there is a saying "redheads should not wear pink."  In this shot, I love how the orange glow of the red hair works with the black of the hat and the blue of the fog.  I like the wide shot of the fog.  But that pink thigh and knee I find realy distracting. I wonder if the shot could work if cropped just above the elbow?</td>', 'In some cultures there is a saying "redheads should not wear pink."  In this shot, I love how the orange glow of the red hair works with the black of the hat and the blue of the fog.  I like the wide shot of the fog.  But that pink thigh and knee I find realy distracting. I wonder if the shot could work if cropped just above the elbow?', '2006-10-11 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918653, 408048, 61958, '<td valign="top">Does it count as faceless if it still show a''face'' not sure. never the less this is a wonderful photo. might have light it a little more from the left to clear the shadow from the mask (unless that was your intent). other then that very well executed.</td>', 'Does it count as faceless if it still show a''face'' not sure. never the less this is a wonderful photo. might have light it a little more from the left to clear the shadow from the mask (unless that was your intent). other then that very well executed.', '2006-10-11 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918656, 407510, 8643, '<td valign="top">Neat trick, Dan!</td>', 'Neat trick, Dan!', '2006-10-11 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918664, 408469, 61958, '<td valign="top">if the subect of this is supposed to be the Person then the dog does nothing for this picture, just the legs would have done better I think. if the subject is the dog, then this isn''t really a faceless. either way a bit more though in the execution of this photo would go along way.</td>', 'if the subect of this is supposed to be the Person then the dog does nothing for this picture, just the legs would have done better I think. if the subject is the dog, then this isn''t really a faceless. either way a bit more though in the execution of this photo would go along way.', '2006-10-11 14:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918670, 408467, 61958, '<td valign="top">I love the concept of this shot but the picture and towel rack by his head are really distracting to the shot you might have considered taking them down before the shot.</td>', 'I love the concept of this shot but the picture and towel rack by his head are really distracting to the shot you might have considered taking them down before the shot.', '2006-10-11 14:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918672, 408092, 61958, '<td valign="top">Bit more shading at the face would have helped... if you can still see it it''s not really faceless.</td>', 'Bit more shading at the face would have helped... if you can still see it it''s not really faceless.', '2006-10-11 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918701, 407539, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color, tones, and texture in this shot.  Most importantly, a story is being told about the person that is the subject of this image.  Well done on both counts - photo of merit and meeting the challenge theme.</td>', 'Wonderful color, tones, and texture in this shot.  Most importantly, a story is being told about the person that is the subject of this image.  Well done on both counts - photo of merit and meeting the challenge theme.', '2006-10-11 14:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918713, 407952, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Is that a mirror?  Wonderful job of processing this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Is that a mirror?  Wonderful job of processing this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918716, 408268, 8643, '<td valign="top">My generation!  Evocative image, my compliments.</td>', 'My generation!  Evocative image, my compliments.', '2006-10-11 15:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918720, 408213, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. "Essence of the person" ???  Well, the environment fits, although some activity that shows she''s a cowgirl would help sell the story a little better.  Nonetheless - an image to be proud of.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. "Essence of the person" ???  Well, the environment fits, although some activity that shows she''s a cowgirl would help sell the story a little better.  Nonetheless - an image to be proud of.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918731, 408469, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pembroke Welsh Corgi...awwwhhh.  I had a little guy like that once.  This pic makes me miss him.  :(  Could have been twins.  <br/> <br/>As for the image, the technicals are there.  Storyline?  Does it tell the "essence of the person"?  Little bit thin in that regard.  This photo seems to be more about the dog than the person.  JMO of course.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pembroke Welsh Corgi...awwwhhh.  I had a little guy like that once.  This pic makes me miss him.  :(  Could have been twins.   As for the image, the technicals are there.  Storyline?  Does it tell the "essence of the person"?  Little bit thin in that regard.  This photo seems to be more about the dog than the person.  JMO of course.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 15:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918745, 408110, 66938, '<td valign="top">oh, this picture reminds me of being a tomboy in my younger days!</td>', 'oh, this picture reminds me of being a tomboy in my younger days!', '2006-10-11 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918773, 408345, 30049, '<td valign="top">The color of the guys jacket really stands out well in this scene.  If he was alone it would work better.  Looks like you had ideal lighting conditions (overcast skies) for this particular shot.  <br/> <br/>Not sure that this challenge is really a good fit for multiple portraits, and their activity isn''t really stating strongly the "essence" of the person.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'The color of the guys jacket really stands out well in this scene.  If he was alone it would work better.  Looks like you had ideal lighting conditions (overcast skies) for this particular shot.   Not sure that this challenge is really a good fit for multiple portraits, and their activity isn''t really stating strongly the "essence" of the person.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 15:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
