(2919812, 407725, 14614, '<td valign="top">I am [usually] not a fan of this technique but you''ve used it well as it plays into the composition.  Not sure about the fit of title and effect (a slight negative).  One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'I am [usually] not a fan of this technique but you''ve used it well as it plays into the composition.  Not sure about the fit of title and effect (a slight negative).  One of my ribbon picks.', '2006-10-11 18:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
