(2920248, 407521, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like this shot.  very quirky.  The lines are facinating, how the boat leans one way and the horizon leans another, and his jacket pockets lean both ways, all leading into the subject who has a perfectly fitting odd pose.  the shifted bordering works for me too.</td>', 'i really like this shot.  very quirky.  The lines are facinating, how the boat leans one way and the horizon leans another, and his jacket pockets lean both ways, all leading into the subject who has a perfectly fitting odd pose.  the shifted bordering works for me too.', '2006-10-11 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920263, 407539, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting how the metal mimmics the rope...i think it really helps keep one''s eyes moving around your image.  i''m curious how many would think this image better without it partially covering the man''s face</td>', 'interesting how the metal mimmics the rope...i think it really helps keep one''s eyes moving around your image.  i''m curious how many would think this image better without it partially covering the man''s face', '2006-10-11 21:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920272, 408482, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting idea for the glow.  gives this a very ethereal feel. almost like the spirit is inside her at this moment</td>', 'interesting idea for the glow.  gives this a very ethereal feel. almost like the spirit is inside her at this moment', '2006-10-11 21:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920277, 408258, 13688, '<td valign="top">the lighting give this a very cool, creepy feel for me.  Of course, the toting eggplants doesn''t help to emphasize it, though ;)</td>', 'the lighting give this a very cool, creepy feel for me.  Of course, the toting eggplants doesn''t help to emphasize it, though ;)', '2006-10-11 21:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920301, 406867, 13688, '<td valign="top">hey... i think your shadow boost editing was very helpful. maybe just a bit overprocessed in spots...i wish you had gone a step further and burned down the background including the other cowboy, as it is highly distracting as is.  if you could have gotten this guy singled out in more of the middle of the ring it would have been a great shot.  Of course, the bull looking at you is kind of funny, but if that was to be the focus of the image you would have had to call it "Portrait of a Bull" and then you''d be getting all sorts of DNMC comments right now.</td>', 'hey... i think your shadow boost editing was very helpful. maybe just a bit overprocessed in spots...i wish you had gone a step further and burned down the background including the other cowboy, as it is highly distracting as is.  if you could have gotten this guy singled out in more of the middle of the ring it would have been a great shot.  Of course, the bull looking at you is kind of funny, but if that was to be the focus of the image you would have had to call it "Portrait of a Bull" and then you''d be getting all sorts of DNMC comments right now.', '2006-10-11 21:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920331, 408306, 13688, '<td valign="top">if you had completely covered the right eye, i''d be freaking out right now.  still as is this photo breaks most rules in the dpc book.  flattery, perhaps would require a different angle.</td>', 'if you had completely covered the right eye, i''d be freaking out right now.  still as is this photo breaks most rules in the dpc book.  flattery, perhaps would require a different angle.', '2006-10-11 21:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920419, 408181, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice find. if you only could have swung to an angle that got the motorcycle more defined by itself in the background.  currently i feel it hurts the composition, but in another location with those leather jackets, it could super strengthen the image for me.</td>', 'nice find. if you only could have swung to an angle that got the motorcycle more defined by itself in the background.  currently i feel it hurts the composition, but in another location with those leather jackets, it could super strengthen the image for me.', '2006-10-11 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920427, 407571, 13688, '<td valign="top">technically very well done.  I wish we had a better vantage point over his shoulder of what he''s doing.</td>', 'technically very well done.  I wish we had a better vantage point over his shoulder of what he''s doing.', '2006-10-11 21:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920439, 407424, 13688, '<td valign="top">soft focus and desat helps create an interesting mood.  All these lines are a nice find.  I''m left wondering if there was another angle that made this rather mundane scene incredibly image worthy</td>', 'soft focus and desat helps create an interesting mood.  All these lines are a nice find.  I''m left wondering if there was another angle that made this rather mundane scene incredibly image worthy', '2006-10-11 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920463, 407264, 13688, '<td valign="top">bottom left corner of this photo is very interesting, compositionally, to me.  The other parts just seem to distract from your main target.  Outside of dpc i think your idea for processing works very well</td>', 'bottom left corner of this photo is very interesting, compositionally, to me.  The other parts just seem to distract from your main target.  Outside of dpc i think your idea for processing works very well', '2006-10-11 21:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920522, 408234, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice.  this reminded me of a shot by antimethod, though his went much further.  I like your idea for having your processing allow the shoes to become part of the wood.</td>', 'nice.  this reminded me of a shot by antimethod, though his went much further.  I like your idea for having your processing allow the shoes to become part of the wood.', '2006-10-11 22:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920548, 408550, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting how you left space only on the right. i''m not sure it helps your composition.</td>', 'interesting how you left space only on the right. i''m not sure it helps your composition.', '2006-10-11 22:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920570, 408422, 59470, '<td valign="top">is she filing her nails?</td>', 'is she filing her nails?', '2006-10-11 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920575, 408437, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting.  i''m being too critical, but it looks like you tried to tone down your highlights and overdid it.  personally I would have liked to see the extreme contrast.  oh, and i''d really like to see the same amount of empty space below the elbow as above the hand.  have a nice day.</td>', 'interesting lighting.  i''m being too critical, but it looks like you tried to tone down your highlights and overdid it.  personally I would have liked to see the extreme contrast.  oh, and i''d really like to see the same amount of empty space below the elbow as above the hand.  have a nice day.', '2006-10-11 22:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920600, 408487, 13688, '<td valign="top">a "Tool" song comes to mind.  dig the lighting and processing...don''t dig the creepy, naked guy acting like a 5 year old...but hey it is your art.</td>', 'a "Tool" song comes to mind.  dig the lighting and processing...don''t dig the creepy, naked guy acting like a 5 year old...but hey it is your art.', '2006-10-11 22:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920603, 407002, 59470, '<td valign="top">great perspective!  an unexpected surprise!</td>', 'great perspective!  an unexpected surprise!', '2006-10-11 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920609, 408476, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m left wondering why you didn''t use a plain background.  also i like the idea of the daughter angle, but would have liked to seen her hair down so she does indeed appear more feminine, rather than like the original</td>', 'i''m left wondering why you didn''t use a plain background.  also i like the idea of the daughter angle, but would have liked to seen her hair down so she does indeed appear more feminine, rather than like the original', '2006-10-11 22:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920628, 408554, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is a very soothing shot, though you''d think it would be a much more strenuous effort for him to reel in that freighter he has hooked ;)</td>', 'this is a very soothing shot, though you''d think it would be a much more strenuous effort for him to reel in that freighter he has hooked ;)', '2006-10-11 22:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920645, 408557, 13688, '<td valign="top">at first i hated it, and i''m sure frankie would too, but oddly the more i stare, the more this composition grows on me.  very well lit and focused...hmmmm.  that green blob counter balancing the collar and the whisp of hair over his bald spot is quite interesting</td>', 'at first i hated it, and i''m sure frankie would too, but oddly the more i stare, the more this composition grows on me.  very well lit and focused...hmmmm.  that green blob counter balancing the collar and the whisp of hair over his bald spot is quite interesting', '2006-10-11 22:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920652, 407465, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure if you cropped down or zoomed in to avoid distracting background elements, but it seems you went too far.  The quality and composition have suffered for me.</td>', 'i''m not sure if you cropped down or zoomed in to avoid distracting background elements, but it seems you went too far.  The quality and composition have suffered for me.', '2006-10-11 22:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
