(2920669, 406551, 32133, '<td valign="top">too cool</td>', 'too cool', '2006-10-11 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920671, 408548, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting treatment.  this has a strong 70''s vibe for me</td>', 'interesting treatment.  this has a strong 70''s vibe for me', '2006-10-11 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920686, 407510, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2006-10-11 23:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920786, 408438, 51750, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, my only problem with it is the persective. You shouldve used a longer lens</td>', 'This is a great photo, my only problem with it is the persective. You shouldve used a longer lens', '2006-10-11 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920814, 407278, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like door as frame and the connectedness of all the black shapes. You''ve also captured something very important about your subject. 9</td>', 'I like door as frame and the connectedness of all the black shapes. You''ve also captured something very important about your subject. 9', '2006-10-11 23:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920817, 408001, 50695, '<td valign="top">You look like Mandy Turner. This shot has a great feel to it. Reminds me of photos of the original punk rock scene. I could easily believe this was a portrait of Iggy Pop taken by Richard Avedon in 1978. 9</td>', 'You look like Mandy Turner. This shot has a great feel to it. Reminds me of photos of the original punk rock scene. I could easily believe this was a portrait of Iggy Pop taken by Richard Avedon in 1978. 9', '2006-10-11 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920822, 408487, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the prickly texture that extends from his skin through his hair to the highlight on the wall. Your title really refines the disturbing feeling of this photo, suggesting that photography itself is a form of abuse. 9</td>', 'I love the prickly texture that extends from his skin through his hair to the highlight on the wall. Your title really refines the disturbing feeling of this photo, suggesting that photography itself is a form of abuse. 9', '2006-10-11 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920832, 406903, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing how a simple gesture transforms the wall into a landscape of the mind. the rectangles turn into thoughts. We wonder about the tiles... what is it that composes our thoughts? Could those be the fears, the hidden motivations behind all ideas? 9</td>', 'amazing how a simple gesture transforms the wall into a landscape of the mind. the rectangles turn into thoughts. We wonder about the tiles... what is it that composes our thoughts? Could those be the fears, the hidden motivations behind all ideas? 9', '2006-10-11 23:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920841, 408110, 61329, '<td valign="top">Great original idea. Love the black and white.</td>', 'Great original idea. Love the black and white.', '2006-10-11 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920843, 408437, 61329, '<td valign="top">Great definition and lighting. Intense.</td>', 'Great definition and lighting. Intense.', '2006-10-11 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920844, 407790, 50695, '<td valign="top">creepy as hell, it reminds me of the Dadaists/Surrealists trying to undermine high culture as well as art... and the picture itself looks to be from that time, even though it is in color. 10</td>', 'creepy as hell, it reminds me of the Dadaists/Surrealists trying to undermine high culture as well as art... and the picture itself looks to be from that time, even though it is in color. 10', '2006-10-11 23:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920853, 408260, 61329, '<td valign="top">Just cool.  Black and red mixing well here with great originality. Love the hat.</td>', 'Just cool.  Black and red mixing well here with great originality. Love the hat.', '2006-10-11 23:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920854, 408523, 50695, '<td valign="top">expressive coil of body counterposed by expressive straight line with varying highlight, further complicated by a curving stain in the floor. It doesn''t necessarily say "loss" to me but it does say "photography". 9</td>', 'expressive coil of body counterposed by expressive straight line with varying highlight, further complicated by a curving stain in the floor. It doesn''t necessarily say "loss" to me but it does say "photography". 9', '2006-10-11 23:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920859, 407628, 61329, '<td valign="top">Shot wouldn''t be what it is without the hair color. Good choice.</td>', 'Shot wouldn''t be what it is without the hair color. Good choice.', '2006-10-11 23:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920861, 407421, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautifully creepy picture. I''m not sure how I feel about the knob over her head, but everything else is perfect. maybe the knob makes it better than perfect. or maybe it should be cloned out. I can''t decide! 9</td>', 'beautifully creepy picture. I''m not sure how I feel about the knob over her head, but everything else is perfect. maybe the knob makes it better than perfect. or maybe it should be cloned out. I can''t decide! 9', '2006-10-12 00:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920877, 408277, 50695, '<td valign="top">You use perspective to get the whole door into the shot, which visually justifies the cropping off of the head, as does shooting from the floor. I wish the highlights inside the doorhole were... I dunno... something more mysterious. But the rest of the shot wins my confidence and I am still able to wonder about it fruitfully. 9</td>', 'You use perspective to get the whole door into the shot, which visually justifies the cropping off of the head, as does shooting from the floor. I wish the highlights inside the doorhole were... I dunno... something more mysterious. But the rest of the shot wins my confidence and I am still able to wonder about it fruitfully. 9', '2006-10-12 00:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920879, 408127, 50695, '<td valign="top">heartwrenchingly sweet picture without seeing the baby''s face. well done. 9</td>', 'heartwrenchingly sweet picture without seeing the baby''s face. well done. 9', '2006-10-12 00:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920890, 407539, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the red and green. dynamic composition, with subject''s "lines" going directly against the framing lines. perfect fulfillment of challenge. some of the background elements toward the top are a little distracting, though. 8</td>', 'love the red and green. dynamic composition, with subject''s "lines" going directly against the framing lines. perfect fulfillment of challenge. some of the background elements toward the top are a little distracting, though. 8', '2006-10-12 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920894, 408110, 50695, '<td valign="top">she''s better off being a tomboy. I fell in love with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">meanwile</a> because she doesn''t throw like a girl. Creative yet perfectly on target fulfillment of the challenge. 8</td>', 'she''s better off being a tomboy. I fell in love with  meanwile because she doesn''t throw like a girl. Creative yet perfectly on target fulfillment of the challenge. 8', '2006-10-12 00:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920898, 406151, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the minimal use of highlights to suggest the form. 8</td>', 'I like the minimal use of highlights to suggest the form. 8', '2006-10-12 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920902, 408388, 50695, '<td valign="top">Diane Arbus turned backwards! Compelling portrait, with just the right sort of Saturday Evening Post processing... yes, that''s right: Diane Arbus meets Norman Rockwell! 8</td>', 'Diane Arbus turned backwards! Compelling portrait, with just the right sort of Saturday Evening Post processing... yes, that''s right: Diane Arbus meets Norman Rockwell! 8', '2006-10-12 00:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
