(2920919, 408234, 50695, '<td valign="top">good composition! Interesting to see the subject from the subject''s point of view! Creates an altogether different and intense form of intimacy with the subject. 8</td>', 'good composition! Interesting to see the subject from the subject''s point of view! Creates an altogether different and intense form of intimacy with the subject. 8', '2006-10-12 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
