(2922041, 408330, 5354, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, you want us to press that button requesting verification don''t you ;-)<br/>Now is it a piece of card or is it photoshop ......  heheh - nice work, made me smile.</td>', 'Oh boy, you want us to press that button requesting verification don''t you ;-)Now is it a piece of card or is it photoshop ......  heheh - nice work, made me smile.', '2006-10-12 11:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
