(2922073, 406685, 5354, '<td valign="top">Tremendous use of light here. I hope all those people who entered ''dull as ditchwater'' images see this and really study the lighting. Listen up people ... look here for an example of great work.</td>', 'Tremendous use of light here. I hope all those people who entered ''dull as ditchwater'' images see this and really study the lighting. Listen up people ... look here for an example of great work.', '2006-10-12 11:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
