(2922080, 406551, 39825, '<td valign="top">*ggg* cool!!</td>', '*ggg* cool!!', '2006-10-12 11:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922097, 408556, 5354, '<td valign="top">Yeah the mothers face is hidden but the real star is the baby, so as a faceless portrait its sort of not true to the spirit of the challenge. I''m not a stickler for the letter of the law, so I''ll let that slide by.<br/> <br/>The image is nice and soft as it should be, but the only sharp element is the hair of the mother. That feels wrong. My eyes want to rest on the baby, but they keep getting drawn back up. The basic structure of the image is therefore a trouble to me. Its not an easy image to look at in that respect.</td>', 'Yeah the mothers face is hidden but the real star is the baby, so as a faceless portrait its sort of not true to the spirit of the challenge. I''m not a stickler for the letter of the law, so I''ll let that slide by. The image is nice and soft as it should be, but the only sharp element is the hair of the mother. That feels wrong. My eyes want to rest on the baby, but they keep getting drawn back up. The basic structure of the image is therefore a trouble to me. Its not an easy image to look at in that respect.', '2006-10-12 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922103, 407432, 62723, '<td valign="top">if I could vote, I would score this an 8 for orginality, lighting and colors. The off centering on this image kept from saying this was a 9. Overall I love the picture, well done and hopefully you will ribbon.<br/> <br/>taka<br/>www.typhotos.com</td>', 'if I could vote, I would score this an 8 for orginality, lighting and colors. The off centering on this image kept from saying this was a 9. Overall I love the picture, well done and hopefully you will ribbon. takawww.typhotos.com', '2006-10-12 11:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922107, 408341, 5354, '<td valign="top">To make this sort of image work you have to have some element that is outstanding. It can be the lighting or the composition or whatever. This image really struggles for anything extra-ordinary. Probably great in a family album.</td>', 'To make this sort of image work you have to have some element that is outstanding. It can be the lighting or the composition or whatever. This image really struggles for anything extra-ordinary. Probably great in a family album.', '2006-10-12 11:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922109, 408559, 5354, '<td valign="top">Dark and just a little scary</td>', 'Dark and just a little scary', '2006-10-12 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922145, 408258, 5354, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from underexposure quite badly</td>', 'This image suffers from underexposure quite badly', '2006-10-12 12:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922146, 408257, 5354, '<td valign="top">Yeah nice reflection and good work on the sky</td>', 'Yeah nice reflection and good work on the sky', '2006-10-12 12:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922147, 405518, 5354, '<td valign="top">Feels a little ''close'', probably do with just stepping back half a yard</td>', 'Feels a little ''close'', probably do with just stepping back half a yard', '2006-10-12 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922151, 405103, 5354, '<td valign="top">Dramatic</td>', 'Dramatic', '2006-10-12 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922172, 408214, 5354, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that sky dreadful?<br/>A silhouette has to have somethiong to make it pop, and by definition it can''t be the silhouetted element. The sky is so dull that the whole tone of the image is just dreary. Sorry<br/> <br/>I know this is almost the same comment as the one I left on your an image almost the same as this one. Both are as dreary as each other.</td>', 'Isn''t that sky dreadful?A silhouette has to have somethiong to make it pop, and by definition it can''t be the silhouetted element. The sky is so dull that the whole tone of the image is just dreary. Sorry I know this is almost the same comment as the one I left on your an image almost the same as this one. Both are as dreary as each other.', '2006-10-12 12:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922316, 408437, 33672, '<td valign="top">What can you say about this other than its perfect! Great lighting and masterful shadows. 10 (any other score couldn''t be validated.)</td>', 'What can you say about this other than its perfect! Great lighting and masterful shadows. 10 (any other score couldn''t be validated.)', '2006-10-12 13:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922317, 408521, 33672, '<td valign="top">Another masterful job. I like the rule of thirds comp and the incredibly interesting sky.Lighting is perfect. 10</td>', 'Another masterful job. I like the rule of thirds comp and the incredibly interesting sky.Lighting is perfect. 10', '2006-10-12 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922327, 407725, 33672, '<td valign="top">Eirie but great. I like the tones and the originality of this. A couple of imperfection by the feet detract slightly. Still a 9. Very, very nice.</td>', 'Eirie but great. I like the tones and the originality of this. A couple of imperfection by the feet detract slightly. Still a 9. Very, very nice.', '2006-10-12 13:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922329, 407510, 33672, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and execution. Lighting and shadows are perfect and subject matter is interesting. Nice take on theme. 9</td>', 'Excellent idea and execution. Lighting and shadows are perfect and subject matter is interesting. Nice take on theme. 9', '2006-10-12 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922332, 408229, 33672, '<td valign="top">Too cool. Great sky and wide angle.  I really like the lighting and the shadow play. Nice comp and surreal subject...9</td>', 'Too cool. Great sky and wide angle.  I really like the lighting and the shadow play. Nice comp and surreal subject...9', '2006-10-12 13:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922338, 408494, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is just too cool.  The tone are subtle but interesting and the lighting is perfect. Subject matter is...well too cool. 9</td>', 'This is just too cool.  The tone are subtle but interesting and the lighting is perfect. Subject matter is...well too cool. 9', '2006-10-12 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922340, 407510, 55908, '<td valign="top">This photo made me laugh; I like it! This represents how I feel sometimes after submitting a photo to a challenge! "Off with his head!!!" Not in your case though, this is great! I do hope you''ll explain how it was done! 8o)</td>', 'This photo made me laugh; I like it! This represents how I feel sometimes after submitting a photo to a challenge! "Off with his head!!!" Not in your case though, this is great! I do hope you''ll explain how it was done! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922342, 406551, 55908, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! Great idea, well captured, clean, and I love the duotone! Excellent shot! 8o)</td>', 'One of my favorites! Great idea, well captured, clean, and I love the duotone! Excellent shot! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922345, 408110, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, great idea and execution.  Very sharp and I like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Interesting subject, great idea and execution.  Very sharp and I like the B&W.', '2006-10-12 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922347, 408454, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is great! I''ve never thought of using and elephant''s head for a background! Well done! 8o)</td>', 'This is great! I''ve never thought of using and elephant''s head for a background! Well done! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922348, 408224, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love motorcycle photos and this a good one. Nice, nice background and perspective. I really like the sky and comp.</td>', 'I love motorcycle photos and this a good one. Nice, nice background and perspective. I really like the sky and comp.', '2006-10-12 13:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922352, 406551, 33672, '<td valign="top">A bit sharper and this get a 10 from me. Original and interesting you really gave a great example of the theme!</td>', 'A bit sharper and this get a 10 from me. Original and interesting you really gave a great example of the theme!', '2006-10-12 13:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922355, 408562, 55908, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! The hat acts as a distraction to me more than a beneficial element to the image as it sticks out from the sides of the gray card. Nonetheless, a job well done. 8o)</td>', 'Cool idea! The hat acts as a distraction to me more than a beneficial element to the image as it sticks out from the sides of the gray card. Nonetheless, a job well done. 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922359, 408432, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great point of veiw! B&amp;W works perfectly, good choice! Unique and fresh interpretation of the challenge. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'Great point of veiw! B&W works perfectly, good choice! Unique and fresh interpretation of the challenge. Well done! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922363, 408437, 55908, '<td valign="top">Amazing texture! I''m sure you''ve seen plenty of comments point out that nice detail. Very dramatic! I''m usually put off by portraits of statuesque models, but this is so compelling! Very well done! 8o)</td>', 'Amazing texture! I''m sure you''ve seen plenty of comments point out that nice detail. Very dramatic! I''m usually put off by portraits of statuesque models, but this is so compelling! Very well done! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922368, 408275, 55908, '<td valign="top">The reflection really makes this image! That beautiful subtle blue glow is perfect! I hope you don''t get hit too hard for being slightly less litteral about the challenge, but I''ve never been one to adhere to stict rules myself. Lovely image! 8o)</td>', 'The reflection really makes this image! That beautiful subtle blue glow is perfect! I hope you don''t get hit too hard for being slightly less litteral about the challenge, but I''ve never been one to adhere to stict rules myself. Lovely image! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922374, 406883, 55908, '<td valign="top">Cool interpretation of the challenge and very nice pallete! I almost thought she was flippin me off for a second there! 8o)</td>', 'Cool interpretation of the challenge and very nice pallete! I almost thought she was flippin me off for a second there! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922387, 406640, 55908, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the image overall is a bit dark and could use some contrast work. Double check focus too. 8o)</td>', 'Nice idea, but the image overall is a bit dark and could use some contrast work. Double check focus too. 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922393, 407424, 55908, '<td valign="top">I really really like this! It pains me to say though that it''s a bit soft. Really fantastic idea though. You might even consider moving your subject to the stool just left where he''d be in the light. Such a nice ecclectic feel though! Very unique! 8o)</td>', 'I really really like this! It pains me to say though that it''s a bit soft. Really fantastic idea though. You might even consider moving your subject to the stool just left where he''d be in the light. Such a nice ecclectic feel though! Very unique! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922395, 405330, 55908, '<td valign="top">Awesome! The wind-swept look adds such a great element of drama! Maybe a little more dof could have bumped this image up a few spots, but well done overall. 8o)</td>', 'Awesome! The wind-swept look adds such a great element of drama! Maybe a little more dof could have bumped this image up a few spots, but well done overall. 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922398, 405521, 55908, '<td valign="top">Well it''s good technically. Maybe a little to far off the mark to be in this challenge though?</td>', 'Well it''s good technically. Maybe a little to far off the mark to be in this challenge though?', '2006-10-12 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922405, 408482, 55908, '<td valign="top">One of the very few photos where selective saturation works for the subject and not against it. Slightly over-processed for my taste, but i try to leave that out of voting for obviously well-constructed images such as this. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'One of the very few photos where selective saturation works for the subject and not against it. Slightly over-processed for my taste, but i try to leave that out of voting for obviously well-constructed images such as this. Well done! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922411, 404992, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very emotive. Maybe a black background would have really driven the message home. Great image though! 8o)</td>', 'Very emotive. Maybe a black background would have really driven the message home. Great image though! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922417, 407725, 55908, '<td valign="top">I think the negative filter adds too much light and vitality to an image that''s trying to communicate a dark emotion. Good idea, maybe a little overboard with pp though imo.</td>', 'I think the negative filter adds too much light and vitality to an image that''s trying to communicate a dark emotion. Good idea, maybe a little overboard with pp though imo.', '2006-10-12 13:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922435, 407397, 55908, '<td valign="top">Kind of lost the highlights there. Nice perspective though. Maybe bringing the subject a bit closer to the viewer might give this image more impact.</td>', 'Kind of lost the highlights there. Nice perspective though. Maybe bringing the subject a bit closer to the viewer might give this image more impact.', '2006-10-12 13:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922452, 406874, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wonderful interpretation of the challenge! 8o)</td>', 'Wonderful interpretation of the challenge! 8o)', '2006-10-12 13:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
