(2922502, 406640, 53572, '<td valign="top">it''s a lovely compostion, but there''s just too much working against it.  i''m afraid the out of focus doesn''t work here, as it does not look purposeful; just off, not soft or selective.  the lighting is a bit flat, with no real shadows or highlights.<br/> <br/>just a thought on the focus - how are you saving for DPC?  that may be the problem - check out the preparing images for DPC tutorial in the learning section.</td>', 'it''s a lovely compostion, but there''s just too much working against it.  i''m afraid the out of focus doesn''t work here, as it does not look purposeful; just off, not soft or selective.  the lighting is a bit flat, with no real shadows or highlights. just a thought on the focus - how are you saving for DPC?  that may be the problem - check out the preparing images for DPC tutorial in the learning section.', '2006-10-12 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922508, 407497, 53572, '<td valign="top">a interesting idea, but the execution will bring you down.  the focus seems to be a little soft, or the resolution a bit low.  the composition is good, but the lighting is harsh - too bright onthe manequin head, and muddy on the flower.<br/> <br/>a good idea, that needs more work.  keep shooting!</td>', 'a interesting idea, but the execution will bring you down.  the focus seems to be a little soft, or the resolution a bit low.  the composition is good, but the lighting is harsh - too bright onthe manequin head, and muddy on the flower. a good idea, that needs more work.  keep shooting!', '2006-10-12 14:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922517, 408561, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  It''s a perfect title because the photo speaks it without you even knowing what the title is.  Beautiful lighting and focus.</td>', 'I love this one.  It''s a perfect title because the photo speaks it without you even knowing what the title is.  Beautiful lighting and focus.', '2006-10-12 14:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922628, 407667, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this one!Gives you such a sense of being there.  And all the gold in teh bleachers gives it an autumn football feel.  Great job.</td>', 'I like this one!Gives you such a sense of being there.  And all the gold in teh bleachers gives it an autumn football feel.  Great job.', '2006-10-12 14:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922642, 408410, 24454, '<td valign="top">I haven''t generally cared as much for the faceless portraits that cropped off the heads, but it really works in this one.   There is so much emotion in the different ways they are holding the hands of the bride:  one with the intimacy of a new husband, the other protectively like a mom.  It''s beautiful, and I think heads in this particular photo would actually detract from it.  I love it!  Great job!</td>', 'I haven''t generally cared as much for the faceless portraits that cropped off the heads, but it really works in this one.   There is so much emotion in the different ways they are holding the hands of the bride:  one with the intimacy of a new husband, the other protectively like a mom.  It''s beautiful, and I think heads in this particular photo would actually detract from it.  I love it!  Great job!', '2006-10-12 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922649, 408234, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  I love the grain.  I love the composition of just the feet on the wood.   Great job.</td>', 'This is really cool.  I love the grain.  I love the composition of just the feet on the wood.   Great job.', '2006-10-12 14:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
