(2923557, 407914, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, and beautifully processed. I''m unsure of how much of the grandmother''s personality this shows though - to be picky - it perhaps rather puts her down, as though she were only defined by her relationship to her grandchild. Perhaps we need something more of her hands?</td>', 'Fun shot, and beautifully processed. I''m unsure of how much of the grandmother''s personality this shows though - to be picky - it perhaps rather puts her down, as though she were only defined by her relationship to her grandchild. Perhaps we need something more of her hands?', '2006-10-12 19:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923561, 408487, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work here. I like the non-glamourousness of it very much, and the framing of the head with the flash reflection is a nice touch. I think, as a suggestion, a more rigorous crop might have paid dividends, though i can see your point with what you''ve done.</td>', 'Nice work here. I like the non-glamourousness of it very much, and the framing of the head with the flash reflection is a nice touch. I think, as a suggestion, a more rigorous crop might have paid dividends, though i can see your point with what you''ve done.', '2006-10-12 19:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923565, 406158, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this - though those triations will attract much criticism i don''t doubt, and I admit they are confusing. The ''light'' is unsettling - actually, the more I look, the more it unsettles - because of its unnaturalness, rather than its selectivity. The fade to black and the highlights just don''t seem real. It was attractive at first, but it begins to annoy quite quickly now.</td>', 'I like this - though those triations will attract much criticism i don''t doubt, and I admit they are confusing. The ''light'' is unsettling - actually, the more I look, the more it unsettles - because of its unnaturalness, rather than its selectivity. The fade to black and the highlights just don''t seem real. It was attractive at first, but it begins to annoy quite quickly now.', '2006-10-12 19:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
