(2924252, 408482, 60141, '<td valign="top">Great idea for an image, however, I think the subject evokes somber, reflective &amp; quiet but the bright colorful clothes evoke cheerful, excited, happy.  Cool image though.</td>', 'Great idea for an image, however, I think the subject evokes somber, reflective & quiet but the bright colorful clothes evoke cheerful, excited, happy.  Cool image though.', '2006-10-12 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
