(2924296, 406874, 60141, '<td valign="top">Well thought out image in terms of subject.  I think that more dramatic lighting would have helped push the image to the next level, though.</td>', 'Well thought out image in terms of subject.  I think that more dramatic lighting would have helped push the image to the next level, though.', '2006-10-12 23:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
