(2924671, 407198, 6247, '<td valign="top">Very Rock n'' Roll.  The use of line adds a lot of balance to the photograph.  Everything seems to draw attention and focus to the light source.  This is one of those photos that move your eye around and throughout it.  Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Rock n'' Roll.  The use of line adds a lot of balance to the photograph.  Everything seems to draw attention and focus to the light source.  This is one of those photos that move your eye around and throughout it.  Very Nice!', '2006-10-13 03:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
