(2924981, 408092, 61191, '<td valign="top">Gary? Anastasia? This must be a shot from your excessive session you did recently ;) Remebered the model by her remarkable mouth. Yes, I see some parts of her face. Maybe that''s just my monitor calibration. Anyway I don''t yell "DNMC". I think it fits quite well and I love your shot: the lighting is outstanding, the high contrast adds depth to the photo. The atmosphere is intimate but a bit scary too (cause her face is so dark). You did an awesome job here. Can''t wait to see further shots out of this session. Keep it up!</td>', 'Gary? Anastasia? This must be a shot from your excessive session you did recently ;) Remebered the model by her remarkable mouth. Yes, I see some parts of her face. Maybe that''s just my monitor calibration. Anyway I don''t yell "DNMC". I think it fits quite well and I love your shot: the lighting is outstanding, the high contrast adds depth to the photo. The atmosphere is intimate but a bit scary too (cause her face is so dark). You did an awesome job here. Can''t wait to see further shots out of this session. Keep it up!', '2006-10-13 07:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
