(2927678, 407399, 41337, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to hide every face in this shot including the woman''s face in the background thanks to your DOF. Cleverly crafted.</td>', 'You''ve managed to hide every face in this shot including the woman''s face in the background thanks to your DOF. Cleverly crafted.', '2006-10-14 03:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927679, 408487, 41337, '<td valign="top">You you you!!!! :P</td>', 'You you you!!!! :P', '2006-10-14 03:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927680, 408163, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL. I bet that''s a Cuban cigar too!</td>', 'LOL. I bet that''s a Cuban cigar too!', '2006-10-14 03:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927683, 406685, 41337, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an old shot by Heida. The harsh lighting tends to go very well with this shot, IMO.</td>', 'Reminds me of an old shot by Heida. The harsh lighting tends to go very well with this shot, IMO.', '2006-10-14 03:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927684, 408494, 41337, '<td valign="top">You look like that cartoon Spy vs Spy!</td>', 'You look like that cartoon Spy vs Spy!', '2006-10-14 03:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927685, 408308, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea but I kinda wish the rest of her had the energy to match. Btw, the technicals are great. Wouldn''t change a thing regarding that.</td>', 'Very nice idea but I kinda wish the rest of her had the energy to match. Btw, the technicals are great. Wouldn''t change a thing regarding that.', '2006-10-14 03:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927686, 408241, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wow. Although what would have made this shot better if the tiger had... ummm... nevermind. :P</td>', 'Wow. Although what would have made this shot better if the tiger had... ummm... nevermind. :P', '2006-10-14 03:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927713, 408438, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic is really the only word to describe this. The only negative I have is the rock is almost too "interesting". I think a more normal looking rock would have complimented the subject better and keep the focus there.</td>', 'Fantastic is really the only word to describe this. The only negative I have is the rock is almost too "interesting". I think a more normal looking rock would have complimented the subject better and keep the focus there.', '2006-10-14 03:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927717, 408178, 41337, '<td valign="top">I kinda like what you are doing here but it needs to be more personal, IMO. This looks like an office hallway and a sterile one at that, which for me doesn''t tell me much. Had this been someone''s home for example with the usual personal stuff lying about then I could think of many things this figure could represent perhaps even something from my own life. Does that make sense?</td>', 'I kinda like what you are doing here but it needs to be more personal, IMO. This looks like an office hallway and a sterile one at that, which for me doesn''t tell me much. Had this been someone''s home for example with the usual personal stuff lying about then I could think of many things this figure could represent perhaps even something from my own life. Does that make sense?', '2006-10-14 04:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927718, 408048, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL. I just saw this movie yesterday! I like the mask but what''s holding it seems odd to me. Either show a bit more detail or just have the mask visible.</td>', 'LOL. I just saw this movie yesterday! I like the mask but what''s holding it seems odd to me. Either show a bit more detail or just have the mask visible.', '2006-10-14 04:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927721, 407628, 41337, '<td valign="top">No cat! :P I gotta say this is one of my favorites you have entered to date. I love the dark rich shadows and the lighting that just teeters on the extreme.</td>', 'No cat! :P I gotta say this is one of my favorites you have entered to date. I love the dark rich shadows and the lighting that just teeters on the extreme.', '2006-10-14 04:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927723, 408092, 41337, '<td valign="top">Exquisite image. The lighting and pose is very good. I think I might have perferred the model look away from the camera since her face is not what is being lit.</td>', 'Exquisite image. The lighting and pose is very good. I think I might have perferred the model look away from the camera since her face is not what is being lit.', '2006-10-14 04:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927725, 405521, 41337, '<td valign="top">That''s a great shot of a cabbage but...</td>', 'That''s a great shot of a cabbage but...', '2006-10-14 04:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927767, 405173, 67072, '<td valign="top">very funny googly eyes! I like the contrast between the real eyes and the blurry, wrinkled newspaper.</td>', 'very funny googly eyes! I like the contrast between the real eyes and the blurry, wrinkled newspaper.', '2006-10-14 06:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927768, 408214, 67072, '<td valign="top">5this photographer''s right arm gives him a mishapen head...</td>', '5this photographer''s right arm gives him a mishapen head...', '2006-10-14 06:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927845, 408438, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is good - your choice to emphasise the extraordinary/bizarre muscle structure of the shoulder works well, and the bluntness and strength of the fingers; hands are, one would say, even more expressive than faces: we''re used to composing our expressions, both as photographers and as the photographed - but life and experience show more in the hands. The subtlety of the missing finger end, the half-lit nature of it, just adds impact.</td>', 'This is good - your choice to emphasise the extraordinary/bizarre muscle structure of the shoulder works well, and the bluntness and strength of the fingers; hands are, one would say, even more expressive than faces: we''re used to composing our expressions, both as photographers and as the photographed - but life and experience show more in the hands. The subtlety of the missing finger end, the half-lit nature of it, just adds impact.', '2006-10-14 07:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927847, 407048, 6999, '<td valign="top">Amusing that the scene (s)he is painting is so like those beach-rock images we see over and over again here :-) Interesting that one can''t quite be sure of the sex of your subject.</td>', 'Amusing that the scene (s)he is painting is so like those beach-rock images we see over and over again here :-) Interesting that one can''t quite be sure of the sex of your subject.', '2006-10-14 07:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927849, 406685, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - I hope the guy isn''t actually as superficial as this implies - ''look at my muscles!''; Hell, imagine buying shirts ... But that is evidently your point; the man whose shoulder is larger than his head.</td>', 'Good work - I hope the guy isn''t actually as superficial as this implies - ''look at my muscles!''; Hell, imagine buying shirts ... But that is evidently your point; the man whose shoulder is larger than his head.', '2006-10-14 07:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927850, 407536, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. The twisted finger is especially expressive.</td>', 'Good. The twisted finger is especially expressive.', '2006-10-14 07:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927918, 406987, 16241, '<td valign="top">had another look, this one although not technically perfect probably fits<br/>the challenge better than the other.  it means something.  bump</td>', 'had another look, this one although not technically perfect probably fitsthe challenge better than the other.  it means something.  bump', '2006-10-14 08:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927939, 408038, 67075, '<td valign="top">Outstanding</td>', 'Outstanding', '2006-10-14 09:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2928075, 408494, 56658, '<td valign="top">very funny and cool. I love the background but the hat, mask combo makes it.</td>', 'very funny and cool. I love the background but the hat, mask combo makes it.', '2006-10-14 10:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2928077, 408048, 56658, '<td valign="top">not sure how many have read the book or seen the movie but this is pretty good.</td>', 'not sure how many have read the book or seen the movie but this is pretty good.', '2006-10-14 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
