(2928396, 408092, 16230, '<td valign="top">You did an excellent job with the lighting and focus. The use of shadows to hide the face makes the photo fit the challenge nicely. I think my only problem is that, even though its an excellent photo of a naked woman, it doesnt seem to convey much emotion. I bet it scores well though. :D</td>', 'You did an excellent job with the lighting and focus. The use of shadows to hide the face makes the photo fit the challenge nicely. I think my only problem is that, even though its an excellent photo of a naked woman, it doesnt seem to convey much emotion. I bet it scores well though. :D', '2006-10-14 14:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2928397, 408554, 16230, '<td valign="top">Well done! I like it.</td>', 'Well done! I like it.', '2006-10-14 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
