(2928830, 408239, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the game but can appreciate your photo, the detail therein and the location in the background. 8.</td>', 'Not a fan of the game but can appreciate your photo, the detail therein and the location in the background. 8.', '2006-10-14 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
