(2929456, 406640, 13688, '<td valign="top">odd feel to this one due to the soft focus, low contrast and unorthodox crop.  your title adds fuel to the intrigue.</td>', 'odd feel to this one due to the soft focus, low contrast and unorthodox crop.  your title adds fuel to the intrigue.', '2006-10-15 01:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
