(2929829, 408017, 53572, '<td valign="top">an intersting isea - is a fake face not a face?  however, with the focus on the candles rathre than the nun or cross, it is very distracting.  well exposed, but the focus really needs to be improved, or the candles placed more prominently in the compostion, to lessen the importance of the nun figure.</td>', 'an intersting isea - is a fake face not a face?  however, with the focus on the candles rathre than the nun or cross, it is very distracting.  well exposed, but the focus really needs to be improved, or the candles placed more prominently in the compostion, to lessen the importance of the nun figure.', '2006-10-15 10:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929830, 408021, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but the resolution really brings you down in this one.  the composiotn is good, but i would like to see more doen with the exposure,  this is advanced editing, you could have played with the levels much more than you have, creating more drama and visual interest.</td>', 'a nice idea, but the resolution really brings you down in this one.  the composiotn is good, but i would like to see more doen with the exposure,  this is advanced editing, you could have played with the levels much more than you have, creating more drama and visual interest.', '2006-10-15 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929836, 408305, 53572, '<td valign="top">judi?  absolutely stunning.  a 10, and that''s a rarity from me.  exposure, composition, toning, depth of field, focus; superb.  thank you.</td>', 'judi?  absolutely stunning.  a 10, and that''s a rarity from me.  exposure, composition, toning, depth of field, focus; superb.  thank you.', '2006-10-15 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929838, 408107, 53572, '<td valign="top">a wonderful image, an 8 even though i have a tiny technical niggle.  the content of the picture is so powerful it overcomes the slightly overblown bottom.  just a tiny bit deeper tone on the bottom of the image would have made this simply superb.<br/> <br/>the contrast between the texture of hte skin, the size of the man, or preconceptions of large tattooed men, and the tattoo itself, andthe title, work wonderfully.  (it could have been in  unrelatedness too...)</td>', 'a wonderful image, an 8 even though i have a tiny technical niggle.  the content of the picture is so powerful it overcomes the slightly overblown bottom.  just a tiny bit deeper tone on the bottom of the image would have made this simply superb. the contrast between the texture of hte skin, the size of the man, or preconceptions of large tattooed men, and the tattoo itself, andthe title, work wonderfully.  (it could have been in  unrelatedness too...)', '2006-10-15 10:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929841, 408257, 53572, '<td valign="top">superb.  the leading lines work very well, bringing the eye to the man.  the exposure and compostion are spot on.  as with many ohters in this challenge, we can fill in the story, as we can''t see his face.  and you have created an image with fascinating story potential.</td>', 'superb.  the leading lines work very well, bringing the eye to the man.  the exposure and compostion are spot on.  as with many ohters in this challenge, we can fill in the story, as we can''t see his face.  and you have created an image with fascinating story potential.', '2006-10-15 10:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929858, 406987, 36382, '<td valign="top">I  really like this idea and the black and white treatment.  The only thing that is a little bit off in my mind is that the apron looks too new, at least it doesn''t really look like it belongs to the person wearing it.  I might be wrong, but that is the feeling I get when I look at the picture.  Still a very good picture and a good idea.</td>', 'I  really like this idea and the black and white treatment.  The only thing that is a little bit off in my mind is that the apron looks too new, at least it doesn''t really look like it belongs to the person wearing it.  I might be wrong, but that is the feeling I get when I look at the picture.  Still a very good picture and a good idea.', '2006-10-15 11:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929859, 407278, 36382, '<td valign="top">It''s really good how you got that white outline around the top of her body to distinguish her from the dark bushes.  The picture also has a nice feel to it.  I can imagine being there.  In fact, I wish I was.</td>', 'It''s really good how you got that white outline around the top of her body to distinguish her from the dark bushes.  The picture also has a nice feel to it.  I can imagine being there.  In fact, I wish I was.', '2006-10-15 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929861, 408437, 36382, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing.  One of the best in the competition, if not the best.  The only slight thing I would change is to not have his elbow cropped at the bottom.  Still an excellent picture with great lighting.</td>', 'Wow, amazing.  One of the best in the competition, if not the best.  The only slight thing I would change is to not have his elbow cropped at the bottom.  Still an excellent picture with great lighting.', '2006-10-15 11:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929862, 408257, 36382, '<td valign="top">Great reflection.  I love the moody colors.  Excellent picture.</td>', 'Great reflection.  I love the moody colors.  Excellent picture.', '2006-10-15 11:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929863, 407536, 36382, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering what you did to this.  It looks like a painting.  I like it.</td>', 'I''m wondering what you did to this.  It looks like a painting.  I like it.', '2006-10-15 11:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929866, 408015, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  I love the shape of her dress, the ribbon and the heart tights.  I can imagine the face without seeing it, which I think is what this challenge is about.  Well done, good luck!</td>', 'This is very good.  I love the shape of her dress, the ribbon and the heart tights.  I can imagine the face without seeing it, which I think is what this challenge is about.  Well done, good luck!', '2006-10-15 11:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930109, 408117, 22734, '<td valign="top">The brick and mortar around and steel under the feet create a hard and unforgiving background to be balanced against the frailty of human nature. Some images cover the face with hands just to hide but here, the pack of cigarettes on the ground somehow associated with the subject.  Very well captured. bump.</td>', 'The brick and mortar around and steel under the feet create a hard and unforgiving background to be balanced against the frailty of human nature. Some images cover the face with hands just to hide but here, the pack of cigarettes on the ground somehow associated with the subject.  Very well captured. bump.', '2006-10-15 13:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930127, 408271, 41554, '<td valign="top">This looks oversharpened and pixelated... also, the scene is too busy.</td>', 'This looks oversharpened and pixelated... also, the scene is too busy.', '2006-10-15 14:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930130, 408426, 41554, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast could help, imho. Nice idea.</td>', 'A bit more contrast could help, imho. Nice idea.', '2006-10-15 14:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930138, 407198, 41554, '<td valign="top">Good mood, somber and dark. The grain helps too. There''s a strange halo around the model, can''t tell if it''s light or too mush USM.</td>', 'Good mood, somber and dark. The grain helps too. There''s a strange halo around the model, can''t tell if it''s light or too mush USM.', '2006-10-15 14:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930144, 404992, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good and interesting tonal shades to show this otherwise dark subject mater in strong midtones. Bump.</td>', 'Good and interesting tonal shades to show this otherwise dark subject mater in strong midtones. Bump.', '2006-10-15 14:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930145, 406146, 41554, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to show more of the model, or have a different crop. The vest is overpowering, and kind of makes the picture hard to read. Also, the lighting is a bit harsh - direct flash at close range, perhaps.</td>', 'I think you needed to show more of the model, or have a different crop. The vest is overpowering, and kind of makes the picture hard to read. Also, the lighting is a bit harsh - direct flash at close range, perhaps.', '2006-10-15 14:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930147, 406551, 22734, '<td valign="top">Beauty of an image with that Soho gallery look. Very well done. Bump.</td>', 'Beauty of an image with that Soho gallery look. Very well done. Bump.', '2006-10-15 14:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930150, 408305, 22734, '<td valign="top">An expert capture with good contrasts and lovely tones. Bump.</td>', 'An expert capture with good contrasts and lovely tones. Bump.', '2006-10-15 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
