(2930330, 407394, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like your use of negative space and rule of thirds, but I feel as if something is missing. Maybe I''m used to being wowed with lots of post editing. Hmmmm - I think I''d work some burn on the texture of the wall behind the boy.  I might even have him scoot up a bit, so there is a shadow behind him. Good focus and certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like your use of negative space and rule of thirds, but I feel as if something is missing. Maybe I''m used to being wowed with lots of post editing. Hmmmm - I think I''d work some burn on the texture of the wall behind the boy.  I might even have him scoot up a bit, so there is a shadow behind him. Good focus and certainly meets the challenge.', '2006-10-15 15:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930331, 408110, 34134, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well composed.</td>', 'Very creative and well composed.', '2006-10-15 15:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930333, 408432, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and perspective. It leaves me wanting more and I can''t put my finger on it. Maybe if shot from an angle where we see part of your body as well, just not your face.</td>', 'Nice focus and perspective. It leaves me wanting more and I can''t put my finger on it. Maybe if shot from an angle where we see part of your body as well, just not your face.', '2006-10-15 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930334, 405404, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is quite avant garde - different. Not quite sure what to do with it. I like it. The lighting seems a touch harsh. Not really sure how else to comment. Sometimes you see an image and although you like it, you can''t really say much other than that.</td>', 'This is quite avant garde - different. Not quite sure what to do with it. I like it. The lighting seems a touch harsh. Not really sure how else to comment. Sometimes you see an image and although you like it, you can''t really say much other than that.', '2006-10-15 15:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930336, 408228, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the high key effect.  Not sure the ribbons add anything. I like the tattoo.</td>', 'I like the high key effect.  Not sure the ribbons add anything. I like the tattoo.', '2006-10-15 15:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930338, 406892, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the vivid colors and the beautiful bokeh. At first I was put off that the face wasn''t tack sharp, but considering the overall image and the composition, I''m ok with that. Bumping up.</td>', 'I like the vivid colors and the beautiful bokeh. At first I was put off that the face wasn''t tack sharp, but considering the overall image and the composition, I''m ok with that. Bumping up.', '2006-10-15 15:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930340, 406987, 15711, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha. I wonder if this would be more effective if she were in a kitchen setting, or perhaps not so close to the wall, so that the texture of it were more blurred. Still a good idea and I love the curl of the peel falling into the basket.</td>', 'ha ha ha. I wonder if this would be more effective if she were in a kitchen setting, or perhaps not so close to the wall, so that the texture of it were more blurred. Still a good idea and I love the curl of the peel falling into the basket.', '2006-10-15 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
