(2931707, 406551, 5885, '<td valign="top">This photo worked out great for this challenge. Not often that I say that the blue was the best shot in the challenge, but I think my opinion would make it safe to say bere. Congrats.</td>', 'This photo worked out great for this challenge. Not often that I say that the blue was the best shot in the challenge, but I think my opinion would make it safe to say bere. Congrats.', '2006-10-16 01:29:13.000000', NULL, 0),
