(2931722, 408234, 15511, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the way this image appears so controlled, like a still life, that appeals to me. Maybe it''s the geometry of some of the shapes versus the natural lay of the others. The processing really enhances the look. It''s high on my list of finishers...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-16 01:45:08.</i></td>', 'There''s something about the way this image appears so controlled, like a still life, that appeals to me. Maybe it''s the geometry of some of the shapes versus the natural lay of the others. The processing really enhances the look. It''s high on my list of finishers...', '2006-10-16 01:31:18.000000', '2006-10-16 02:45:08.000000', 0),
