(2932042, 406840, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great color and DoF is good except the focus on the subject is soft. I will say that you make taking a portrait oriented photo look like a form of artistic dance. ;-)</td>', 'Great color and DoF is good except the focus on the subject is soft. I will say that you make taking a portrait oriented photo look like a form of artistic dance. ;-)', '2006-10-16 02:44:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2932044, 407510, 23430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by owen:</b></div><hr/><i> You''d better tell us how you did this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Dan, It''s amazing you did it the old fashioned way. I was sure you''d done like a double exposure type of shot. Your execution is spot on, congrats to you and your wife.</td>', 'Originally posted by owen: You''d better tell us how you did this.  Thanks Dan, It''s amazing you did it the old fashioned way. I was sure you''d done like a double exposure type of shot. Your execution is spot on, congrats to you and your wife.', '2006-10-16 02:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2932045, 408308, 28742, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with some of the other comments about the arms hanging lifelessly. If you coulda captured more body movement with the hair, you''da placed much higher. Heck I''m even confident enough to say you woulda ribboned. ;-)</td>', 'I have to agree with some of the other comments about the arms hanging lifelessly. If you coulda captured more body movement with the hair, you''da placed much higher. Heck I''m even confident enough to say you woulda ribboned. ;-)', '2006-10-16 02:47:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2932054, 407952, 45475, '<td valign="top">A few shots along similar lines in this challenge. I felt that the concept showed a good understanding of the criteria: "the essence of a person". But as Sonya says, DPC voters can be fickle. I liked the choices you made with post processing. Particularly the tones, not quite b&amp;w. Zoom blur around the fingertips is a nice touch too, softening the overall feel. Nice going Captain :)</td>', 'A few shots along similar lines in this challenge. I felt that the concept showed a good understanding of the criteria: "the essence of a person". But as Sonya says, DPC voters can be fickle. I liked the choices you made with post processing. Particularly the tones, not quite b&w. Zoom blur around the fingertips is a nice touch too, softening the overall feel. Nice going Captain :)', '2006-10-16 02:50:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2932063, 406551, 48560, '<td valign="top">what''s with the recent ribbon streak anyway, you on steroids? :p<br/>congrats on the big blue! and yes, this photo is original!</td>', 'what''s with the recent ribbon streak anyway, you on steroids? :pcongrats on the big blue! and yes, this photo is original!', '2006-10-16 02:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
