(2932098, 407667, 45475, '<td valign="top">I quite liked the exposure and colour in this one, but I think it was a case of the background screaming for more attention than your subject. Perhaps an even tighter dof next time? Unfortunately, American football fever is a little bit lost on me, I''m afraid, but that doesn''t make your image any less visually exciting :) Good job!</td>', 'I quite liked the exposure and colour in this one, but I think it was a case of the background screaming for more attention than your subject. Perhaps an even tighter dof next time? Unfortunately, American football fever is a little bit lost on me, I''m afraid, but that doesn''t make your image any less visually exciting :) Good job!', '2006-10-16 03:04:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2932101, 408015, 40679, '<td valign="top">oh this is beutiful Crystal!!! added to faves!<br/> <br/>and congrats with the 5th place. You''re on a roll!</td>', 'oh this is beutiful Crystal!!! added to faves! and congrats with the 5th place. You''re on a roll!', '2006-10-16 03:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
