(2932886, 407476, 5885, '<td valign="top">Totally under-rated. Love the work you''ve done here!</td>', 'Totally under-rated. Love the work you''ve done here!', '2006-10-16 10:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2932900, 407397, 66353, '<td valign="top">it''s a nice picture. Lighting and composition is OK, but it''s not even close to being a portrait - faceless or not...<br/>A portrait should tell something about the person - this picture tells something about the place.</td>', 'it''s a nice picture. Lighting and composition is OK, but it''s not even close to being a portrait - faceless or not...A portrait should tell something about the person - this picture tells something about the place.', '2006-10-16 10:13:02.000000', NULL, 0),
