(2940666, 408493, 48389, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club Monica!</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/> <br/>I like your comment about the quick sand!! Love the way you have captured the little boy looking up as if in a dream. Possibly a more square crop would have helped this shot, eliminating the shadow in the foreground.<br/> <br/><b>Technicals:</b> <br/> <br/>Lovely light on the sand and little boys back. I like your DOF, for me this is technically a good image.<br/> <br/><b>My personal thought:</b> <br/> <br/>I am surprised this didnt score higher, I think it fits the challenge well and technically its a good image but maybe lacks a little wow factor? Keep snapping Monica!<br/> <br/>If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system.<br/> <br/>- Natalya :o)</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Monica!  Composition:  I like your comment about the quick sand!! Love the way you have captured the little boy looking up as if in a dream. Possibly a more square crop would have helped this shot, eliminating the shadow in the foreground. Technicals:  Lovely light on the sand and little boys back. I like your DOF, for me this is technically a good image. My personal thought:  I am surprised this didnt score higher, I think it fits the challenge well and technically its a good image but maybe lacks a little wow factor? Keep snapping Monica! If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system. - Natalya :o)', '2006-10-18 14:11:18.000000', NULL, 0),
