(3060899, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nheilweil:</b></div><hr/><i> Well thought out image in terms of subject.  I think that more dramatic lighting would have helped push the image to the next level, though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You''ll have to talk to Mother Nature....that''s all the lighting She provided.</td>', 'Originally posted by nheilweil: Well thought out image in terms of subject.  I think that more dramatic lighting would have helped push the image to the next level, though.  You''ll have to talk to Mother Nature....that''s all the lighting She provided.', '2006-11-25 03:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060900, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by manulail:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, very powerful! You''ve done away with the whole body completely and left these people to our imaginations... The boots, flags, and hat all give us a good indication of who this person is without actually seeing them. Great shot! On the technical side, I wish the shot was dimmer... perhaps lowering the brightness and making it a bit more gloomy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I do NOT do post editing (hate it) .... taken as seen.</td>', 'Originally posted by manulail: Wow, very powerful! You''ve done away with the whole body completely and left these people to our imaginations... The boots, flags, and hat all give us a good indication of who this person is without actually seeing them. Great shot! On the technical side, I wish the shot was dimmer... perhaps lowering the brightness and making it a bit more gloomy.   I do NOT do post editing (hate it) .... taken as seen.', '2006-11-25 03:03:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060901, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Well Done!!!!!!!    This is such an emotive, powerful photo, Good Luck!  I really hope the typically narrow box that dpc voters live in is wide enough to consider this an excellent choice for a challenge like this! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you!!!! They won''t. I didn''t do enough "layering" and "shadowing" and "masking" and such.... I didn''t make this image all sharp and negative grayscale...(is that even a option???"<br/> <br/>I just saw the image and snapped....<br/> <br/>And you were one of the few to get it..... Stop by anytime.</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Well Done!!!!!!!    This is such an emotive, powerful photo, Good Luck!  I really hope the typically narrow box that dpc voters live in is wide enough to consider this an excellent choice for a challenge like this!   Thank you!!!! They won''t. I didn''t do enough "layering" and "shadowing" and "masking" and such.... I didn''t make this image all sharp and negative grayscale...(is that even a option???" I just saw the image and snapped.... And you were one of the few to get it..... Stop by anytime.', '2006-11-25 03:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060902, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chaimelle:</b></div><hr/><i> faceless, yes...portrait, no (at least not to me). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You need more wrinkles on your brain....</td>', 'Originally posted by chaimelle: faceless, yes...portrait, no (at least not to me).   You need more wrinkles on your brain....', '2006-11-25 03:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060903, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 777STAN:</b></div><hr/><i> ...But their HEART lives on and dances with our gratitude that will never die!     Heart-felt Thanks to those I may never meet for gifts and a sacrifice I can never repay!!!!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes.... you get it.</td>', 'Originally posted by 777STAN: ...But their HEART lives on and dances with our gratitude that will never die!     Heart-felt Thanks to those I may never meet for gifts and a sacrifice I can never repay!!!!!!!   Yes.... you get it.', '2006-11-25 03:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060904, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NikonJeb:</b></div><hr/><i> As someone who almost went to Vietnam, but was one year too young, and who lost too many friends, this moves me in a deep way.<br/>Amazing, thoughtful, sad photograph.<br/>Very poignant......nicely done </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yep. This is one of those photos you need to see... not just look at. It''s all in the spider''s web. Simple yet.....<br/>...... loaded.<br/>Thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by NikonJeb: As someone who almost went to Vietnam, but was one year too young, and who lost too many friends, this moves me in a deep way.Amazing, thoughtful, sad photograph.Very poignant......nicely done  Yep. This is one of those photos you need to see... not just look at. It''s all in the spider''s web. Simple yet........... loaded.Thanks.', '2006-11-25 03:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060906, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sacredspirit:</b></div><hr/><i> This idea is the best so far in the challenge, however the execution needs work.  The idea is exteme enough for me, unfortunately the lighting, and the grass on the bottome left, and the colors in general are flat.  GL definately an awesome photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry about the grass and lighting and colors... nature set them there. I will look for the exact same image in some fantasy world where all the colors are bright and purdy...</td>', 'Originally posted by sacredspirit: This idea is the best so far in the challenge, however the execution needs work.  The idea is exteme enough for me, unfortunately the lighting, and the grass on the bottome left, and the colors in general are flat.  GL definately an awesome photo.   Sorry about the grass and lighting and colors... nature set them there. I will look for the exact same image in some fantasy world where all the colors are bright and purdy...', '2006-11-25 03:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3060908, 406874, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> creative fulfillment of the challenge and a moving picture. I think it''s the cobwebs that pull it all together for me. 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You get a Jimmie hug (ummm... if ya are a female that is... a firm handshake if ya are male) It is all about those webs. They act as an anchor for the entire pic. Yep.... it is about the webs.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: creative fulfillment of the challenge and a moving picture. I think it''s the cobwebs that pull it all together for me. 7   You get a Jimmie hug (ummm... if ya are a female that is... a firm handshake if ya are male) It is all about those webs. They act as an anchor for the entire pic. Yep.... it is about the webs.', '2006-11-25 03:13:02.000000', NULL, 0),
